memory sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace heap no
async sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace no
purpose operation sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace "In-place bubble sort of the first byteCount bytes of byteBuffer in non-decreasing order. Returns byteCount."
invariant operation sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace "After return, areBytesSortedAscending(byteBuffer, byteCount) == true."
warning sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace "O(byteCount^2) running time â€” not suitable for buffers larger than a few thousand bytes."
guarantee sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace "Total."
label startSortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace
memory sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace mutable bubbleOuterIndex I64 0
memory sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace mutable bubbleArrayLength I64 0
set memory bubbleArrayLength byteCount
label bubbleOuterHead
call detectBubbleOuterDoneCall math.greaterThanOrEqualI64
argument detectBubbleOuterDoneCall left I64 bubbleOuterIndex
argument detectBubbleOuterDoneCall right I64 bubbleArrayLength
run detectBubbleOuterDoneCall
bind value bubbleOuterDone Bool detectBubbleOuterDoneCall
branch if condition bubbleOuterDone target bubbleSortComplete
memory sortBytesWithBubbleSortInPlace mutable bubbleInnerIndex I64 0
label bubbleInnerHead
call computeBubbleInnerLengthCall math.subtractI64
argument computeBubbleInnerLengthCall left I64 bubbleArrayLength
argument computeBubbleInnerLengthCall right I64 bubbleOuterIndex
run computeBubbleInnerLengthCall
bind value bubbleInnerLength I64 computeBubbleInnerLengthCall
call computeBubbleInnerBoundCall math.subtractI64
argument computeBubbleInnerBoundCall left I64 bubbleInnerLength
argument computeBubbleInnerBoundCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run computeBubbleInnerBoundCall
bind value bubbleInnerBound I64 computeBubbleInnerBoundCall
call detectBubbleInnerDoneCall math.greaterThanOrEqualI64
argument detectBubbleInnerDoneCall left I64 bubbleInnerIndex
argument detectBubbleInnerDoneCall right I64 bubbleInnerBound
run detectBubbleInnerDoneCall
bind value bubbleInnerDone Bool detectBubbleInnerDoneCall
branch if condition bubbleInnerDone target bubbleOuterAdvance
call loadBubbleLeftCall pointer.loadByte
argument loadBubbleLeftCall buffer COpaqueMemoryAddress byteBuffer
argument loadBubbleLeftCall offset CByteCount bubbleInnerIndex
run loadBubbleLeftCall
bind value bubbleLeftRawByte I8 loadBubbleLeftCall
call computeBubbleRightIndexCall math.addI64
argument computeBubbleRightIndexCall left I64 bubbleInnerIndex
argument computeBubbleRightIndexCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run computeBubbleRightIndexCall
bind value bubbleRightIndex I64 computeBubbleRightIndexCall
call loadBubbleRightCall pointer.loadByte
argument loadBubbleRightCall buffer COpaqueMemoryAddress byteBuffer
argument loadBubbleRightCall offset CByteCount bubbleRightIndex
run loadBubbleRightCall
bind value bubbleRightRawByte I8 loadBubbleRightCall
call shiftBubbleLeftCall math.addI64
argument shiftBubbleLeftCall left I64 bubbleLeftRawByte
argument shiftBubbleLeftCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run shiftBubbleLeftCall
bind value shiftedBubbleLeft I64 shiftBubbleLeftCall
call normalizeBubbleLeftCall math.moduloI64
argument normalizeBubbleLeftCall left I64 shiftedBubbleLeft
argument normalizeBubbleLeftCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run normalizeBubbleLeftCall
bind value unsignedBubbleLeft I64 normalizeBubbleLeftCall
call shiftBubbleRightCall math.addI64
argument shiftBubbleRightCall left I64 bubbleRightRawByte
argument shiftBubbleRightCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run shiftBubbleRightCall
bind value shiftedBubbleRight I64 shiftBubbleRightCall
call normalizeBubbleRightCall math.moduloI64
argument normalizeBubbleRightCall left I64 shiftedBubbleRight
argument normalizeBubbleRightCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run normalizeBubbleRightCall
bind value unsignedBubbleRight I64 normalizeBubbleRightCall
call detectBubbleOutOfOrderCall math.greaterThanI64
argument detectBubbleOutOfOrderCall left I64 unsignedBubbleLeft
argument detectBubbleOutOfOrderCall right I64 unsignedBubbleRight
run detectBubbleOutOfOrderCall
bind value bubbleOutOfOrder Bool detectBubbleOutOfOrderCall
branch if condition bubbleOutOfOrder target swapBubblePair
branch else target bubbleInnerAdvance
label swapBubblePair
call storeBubbleRightAtLeftCall pointer.storeByte
argument storeBubbleRightAtLeftCall buffer COpaqueMemoryAddress byteBuffer
argument storeBubbleRightAtLeftCall offset CByteCount bubbleInnerIndex
argument storeBubbleRightAtLeftCall value CSignedInt64 bubbleRightRawByte
run storeBubbleRightAtLeftCall
call storeBubbleLeftAtRightCall pointer.storeByte
argument storeBubbleLeftAtRightCall buffer COpaqueMemoryAddress byteBuffer
argument storeBubbleLeftAtRightCall offset CByteCount bubbleRightIndex
argument storeBubbleLeftAtRightCall value CSignedInt64 bubbleLeftRawByte
run storeBubbleLeftAtRightCall
jump target bubbleInnerAdvance
label bubbleInnerAdvance
call advanceBubbleInnerCall math.addI64
argument advanceBubbleInnerCall left I64 bubbleInnerIndex
argument advanceBubbleInnerCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run advanceBubbleInnerCall
bind value nextBubbleInner I64 advanceBubbleInnerCall
set memory bubbleInnerIndex nextBubbleInner
jump target bubbleInnerHead
label bubbleOuterAdvance
call advanceBubbleOuterCall math.addI64
argument advanceBubbleOuterCall left I64 bubbleOuterIndex
argument advanceBubbleOuterCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run advanceBubbleOuterCall
bind value nextBubbleOuter I64 advanceBubbleOuterCall
set memory bubbleOuterIndex nextBubbleOuter
