# section sort.predicate

operation areBytesSortedAscending
input operation areBytesSortedAscending byteBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString
input operation areBytesSortedAscending byteCount CByteCount
output operation areBytesSortedAscending Bool
memory areBytesSortedAscending heap no
async areBytesSortedAscending no
purpose operation areBytesSortedAscending "Returns true when every adjacent pair satisfies byteBuffer[i] <= byteBuffer[i+1]. Empty and single-element buffers are sorted."
invariant operation areBytesSortedAscending "Short-circuits on the first out-of-order pair; empty / single-element buffers return true."
guarantee areBytesSortedAscending "Total."
label startAreBytesSortedAscending
call detectSingleElementCall math.lessThanOrEqualI64
argument detectSingleElementCall left I64 byteCount
argument detectSingleElementCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run detectSingleElementCall
bind value hasAtMostOneElement Bool detectSingleElementCall
branch if condition hasAtMostOneElement target returnIsSortedTrue
memory areBytesSortedAscending mutable sortedCheckIndex I64 0
call computeSortedCheckBoundCall math.subtractI64
argument computeSortedCheckBoundCall left I64 byteCount
argument computeSortedCheckBoundCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run computeSortedCheckBoundCall
bind value sortedCheckBound I64 computeSortedCheckBoundCall
label sortedCheckLoop
call detectSortedCheckDoneCall math.greaterThanOrEqualI64
argument detectSortedCheckDoneCall left I64 sortedCheckIndex
argument detectSortedCheckDoneCall right I64 sortedCheckBound
run detectSortedCheckDoneCall
bind value sortedCheckDone Bool detectSortedCheckDoneCall
branch if condition sortedCheckDone target returnIsSortedTrue
call loadSortedLeftCall pointer.loadByte
argument loadSortedLeftCall buffer COpaqueMemoryAddress byteBuffer
argument loadSortedLeftCall offset CByteCount sortedCheckIndex
run loadSortedLeftCall
bind value sortedLeftRawByte I8 loadSortedLeftCall
call computeSortedRightIndexCall math.addI64
argument computeSortedRightIndexCall left I64 sortedCheckIndex
argument computeSortedRightIndexCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run computeSortedRightIndexCall
bind value sortedRightIndex I64 computeSortedRightIndexCall
call loadSortedRightCall pointer.loadByte
argument loadSortedRightCall buffer COpaqueMemoryAddress byteBuffer
argument loadSortedRightCall offset CByteCount sortedRightIndex
run loadSortedRightCall
bind value sortedRightRawByte I8 loadSortedRightCall
call shiftSortedLeftCall math.addI64
argument shiftSortedLeftCall left I64 sortedLeftRawByte
argument shiftSortedLeftCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run shiftSortedLeftCall
bind value shiftedSortedLeft I64 shiftSortedLeftCall
call normalizeSortedLeftCall math.moduloI64
argument normalizeSortedLeftCall left I64 shiftedSortedLeft
argument normalizeSortedLeftCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run normalizeSortedLeftCall
bind value unsignedSortedLeft I64 normalizeSortedLeftCall
call shiftSortedRightCall math.addI64
argument shiftSortedRightCall left I64 sortedRightRawByte
argument shiftSortedRightCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run shiftSortedRightCall
bind value shiftedSortedRight I64 shiftSortedRightCall
call normalizeSortedRightCall math.moduloI64
argument normalizeSortedRightCall left I64 shiftedSortedRight
argument normalizeSortedRightCall right I64 byteRoleAdjustmentValue
run normalizeSortedRightCall
bind value unsignedSortedRight I64 normalizeSortedRightCall
call detectSortedOutOfOrderCall math.greaterThanI64
argument detectSortedOutOfOrderCall left I64 unsignedSortedLeft
argument detectSortedOutOfOrderCall right I64 unsignedSortedRight
run detectSortedOutOfOrderCall
bind value sortedOutOfOrder Bool detectSortedOutOfOrderCall
branch if condition sortedOutOfOrder target returnIsSortedFalse
call advanceSortedIndexCall math.addI64
argument advanceSortedIndexCall left I64 sortedCheckIndex
argument advanceSortedIndexCall right I64 integerOneStepValue
run advanceSortedIndexCall
bind value nextSortedIndex I64 advanceSortedIndexCall
set memory sortedCheckIndex nextSortedIndex
jump target sortedCheckLoop
label returnIsSortedTrue
storage module immutable isSortedTrueResult Bool true
return value isSortedTrueResult
label returnIsSortedFalse
storage module immutable isSortedFalseResult Bool false
return value isSortedFalseResult

